---
source: crates/sally-core/tests/snapshots.rs
expression: "stable(&f, &summary(&v.manifest))"
---
This agent:
- uses a model you pick at launch.
- sees no host files.
- has no network access.
- cannot run shell commands.
- is audited at reduced detail (every action and connection is still recorded; per-request HTTP lines, file reads, and inference metadata are not).
- is limited to 2 CPUs, 2GiB memory, 64 processes, and 8h of wall time.
